# A paired phone asking to reach another machine directly, so it keeps it
# while this computer sleeps. $phone is the phone's name, $host the
# machine's.

remote-links-ask-title = 也将 { $phone } 与 { $host } 配对？
remote-links-ask-detail = { $phone } 请求直接访问 { $host }，以便此电脑休眠后仍保持连接。如果 { $host } 上尚未运行远程控制，Sheprd 会将其启动。
remote-links-ask-deny = 暂不
remote-links-ask-allow = 配对
